					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "2026-09-27 architecture change: timer's Pico is now the bomb-wide master and SOURCES +5V out through J1 Pin3 to the downstream communication board (was: received +5V from host). F1 protects the internal +5V/VSYS rail from a downstream short. Sizing is provisional (host-session estimate: ~0.65-0.77A typical, ~1.25-1.3A worst-case for board2 + its 5 module slots + shared-param widget); MF-R185's hold current derates to 1.26A at 60C ambient, below the 1.3A worst case - re-check after real current measurement (see timer_design_notes.md SS0-1)."
			(at 101.6 50.8 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
